'''Javanese literature''' is, generally speaking, literature from [[Java]] and, more specifically, from areas where [[Javanese language|Javanese]] is spoken. However, similar to other literary traditions, Javanese language works were and not necessarily produced only in Java, but also in [[West Java|Sunda]], [[Madura]], [[Bali]], [[Lombok]], [[South Sumatra|Southern Sumatra]] (especially around [[Palembang]]) and [[Suriname]]. This article only deals with Javanese written literature and not with oral literature and [[Javanese theatre]] such as ''[[wayang]]''.
